WEBVTT

00:00:00.326 --> 00:00:03.685
Here's something most creators get wrong
about Shorts.

00:00:03.685 --> 00:00:06.393
They think they need to film new content.
You don't.

00:00:06.393 --> 00:00:10.269
Your best Shorts are already inside
the long videos you've recorded.

00:00:11.162 --> 00:00:12.234
Let me show you.

00:00:12.234 --> 00:00:16.279
This is the video you're watching
right now, inside MintiStudio.

00:00:16.279 --> 00:00:17.723
Here's the transcript.

00:00:17.723 --> 00:00:20.163
I'll select the part I just said.
Right here.

00:00:20.664 --> 00:00:21.664
Click Add.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.484
I'll give it a title.

00:00:23.484 --> 00:00:26.116
Your best Shorts are already filmed.

00:00:26.758 --> 00:00:29.996
And create the clip.

00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:32.161
And just like that,
I'm inside a Short.

00:00:32.575 --> 00:00:36.612
Same video, now vertical,
with captions.

00:00:36.612 --> 00:00:38.234
Now let's make it look like mine.

00:00:38.234 --> 00:00:39.234
I'll open Design.

00:00:39.747 --> 00:00:41.130
There are ready-made styles here.

00:00:41.453 --> 00:00:44.040
Bold, podcast, word highlight.

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:45.100
I'll pick this one.

00:00:46.065 --> 00:00:47.587
I'll make the title background white

00:00:47.925 --> 00:00:49.275
and the text black.

00:00:49.275 --> 00:00:50.651
That's better.

00:00:50.651 --> 00:00:52.101
Here's the part I love.

00:00:52.101 --> 00:00:54.048
Click Save as Default,

00:00:54.048 --> 00:00:56.971
and every new Short gets this same look
automatically.

00:00:57.479 --> 00:01:00.612
You set it up once,
and you never do it again.

00:01:00.612 --> 00:01:02.227
Now, framing.

00:01:02.227 --> 00:01:06.074
With Auto layout, MintiStudio finds
and keeps me centered,

00:01:06.304 --> 00:01:07.450
even when I move.

00:01:08.703 --> 00:01:10.306
And if it's an interview
with two people,

00:01:10.556 --> 00:01:13.216
it stacks them, one on top,
one on the bottom,

00:01:13.379 --> 00:01:14.529
so nobody gets cut out.

00:01:15.685 --> 00:01:17.257
You can also add music,

00:01:17.257 --> 00:01:19.123
a background, your logo,

00:01:19.123 --> 00:01:20.123
or a subscribe button.

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:21.613
Whatever fits your brand.

00:01:22.622 --> 00:01:23.650
One long video.

00:01:24.044 --> 00:01:25.050
A finished Short.

00:01:25.312 --> 00:01:26.404
In just a few clicks.
